#: ../../solid/crystal_structure.rst:2
msgid "結晶構造と格子"
msgstr "Crystal Structure and Lattices"

#: ../../solid/crystal_structure.rst:4
msgid ""
"結晶を\\ :ref:`格子と単位構造<lattice-points>`\\ で表し、\\ :ref:`単位胞<lattice-unit-"
"cells>`\\ と\\ :ref:`分率座標<coordinates>`\\ を導入します。 :ref:`格子定数と計量行列<lattice-"
"metric>`\\ で胞の形を数値で表し、ブラベー格子型と結晶系を学びます。 続いて\\ :ref:`逆格子<reciprocal-"
"lattice>`\\ を導入し、結晶の方向と格子面の指数、原子配置が回折の反射条件にどう関わるかを見ます。"
msgstr ""
"We represent a crystal in terms of a \\ :ref:`lattice and a motif "
"<lattice-points>`\\ , then introduce \\ :ref:`unit cells <lattice-unit-"
"cells>`\\  and \\ :ref:`fractional coordinates <coordinates>`\\ . We "
"describe the cell shape numerically using :ref:`lattice constants and the"
" metric tensor <lattice-metric>`\\  and learn about Bravais lattice types"
" and crystal systems. Next we introduce the \\ :ref:`reciprocal lattice "
"<reciprocal-lattice>`\\ , learn how to index crystal directions and "
"lattice planes, and see how atomic arrangements affect reflection "
"conditions in diffraction."

